### 1. Create Course
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "CS101",
  "courseName": "Database Management Systems",
  "facultyName": "Dr. Kumar"
}

### 2. Get All Courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses

### 3. Get Course By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1

### 4. Create Feedback Form for Course 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/forms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "semester": "2026-27",
  "closingDate": "2026-10-30",
  "questions": [
    {
      "questionText": "The teaching was clear and understandable"
    },
    {
      "questionText": "The course content was relevant and useful"
    },
    {
      "questionText": "The study materials were helpful"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Student Submit Feedback (Student STU001)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/1/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "STU001",
  "ratings": [
    {
      "questionId": 1,
      "rating": 5
    },
    {
      "questionId": 2,
      "rating": 4
    },
    {
      "questionId": 3,
      "rating": 5
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Student Submit Duplicate Feedback (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/1/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "STU001",
  "ratings": [
    {
      "questionId": 1,
      "rating": 5
    },
    {
      "questionId": 2,
      "rating": 4
    },
    {
      "questionId": 3,
      "rating": 5
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Get Form Analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forms/1/analytics

### 8. Get Faculty Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/faculty/Dr. Kumar/summary

### 9. Manually Close Feedback Collection
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/forms/1/close

### 10. Try Submitting After Form Is Closed (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/1/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "STU002",
  "ratings": [
    {
      "questionId": 1,
      "rating": 4
    },
    {
      "questionId": 2,
      "rating": 4
    },
    {
      "questionId": 3,
      "rating": 4
    }
  ]
}
